  "description": "Time-series diagnostics for .NET, at statsmodels parity: the autocorrelation and partial autocorrelation functions with their bands, the Ljung-Box test, the augmented Dickey-Fuller test with MacKinnon p-values, KPSS, and classical seasonal decomposition. Spans in, numbers out, and no dependencies outside Lodestar.",
